{
  "schema": 1,
  "wcs1_version": 1,
  "entity": "spiffe://org/ns/tools/sa/vectors",
  "note": "`expect` is either \"accept\" — in which case `document` is the exact canonical bytes, `manifest` the sha256 over them, and `items` the per-item digests a contract pins — or the WC-* code a conforming implementation must refuse with. `rule` is the normative statement the vector exists to pin. Digests are over the canonical document, not the input file.",
